      {
        "author_name": "Zero Inertia",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115510970789010102298/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWzyfEpIwgoZqFATzgoU-d4YNnQDQN35-ufSX30KmPIlTc7doSf=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "10 months ago",
        "text": "Better service and reliability than before, this company made some updates to improve A LOT on their customer care! Very appreciated!\n\n--For people who praise Uber instead of Taxis; (sure you can) but you're gonna shoot yourself in the foot when you realize prices are not fixed (variable drivers decision) and getting onboard with unverified drivers (complete strangers) so to your own risks.",
        "time": 1744578002,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Jessica Bartolacci",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104838388696693358825/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKOxZTDfOnnKQOd-nl2vR4Pkb9XHtDv3SCXdNjgIG2bLEG0Pg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "I’ve ordered a taxi 3 times in the last couple of years to go to the airport for business trips - arrival at the airport ranges from Sundays and Mondays, with pickup times for 4:30am. I’d call the day before and the dispatcher was nice and professional. On the day of pickup, the driver was always early and took me to the airport in no time, helping me with luggage. This service is 5-star and my go-to taxi service in Vaudreuil.",
        "time": 1711288278,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Mike Montesano",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105409586798932630750/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXrqdco436DGslErHXtRBHqjLOsVCprw4Kzu4-qW2_TD8cK9CSBkg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "9 months ago",
        "text": "My go-to taxi for trips to the airport - always reliable and consistent. Brigette and Mathieu were extremely pleasant and accommodating. Highly recommend!",
        "time": 1745787478,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Orange Julep",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110994872145199184540/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXTEDAqEVPGw5ggvCEt9RQV-dSibGGvhZwm80mKVdNYtubkWCmj=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "Unfortunately service is not the same as it used to be. They have become unreliable if you are booking in advance- they don’t show up on time even if you call to reconfirm. Taxi drivers have become reckless drivers speeding and burning through traffic lights and stop signs. Moreover, very dirty cars and unprofessional drivers. They take no responsibility for bad service. No wonder why Uber is thriving, they make it easy for them to excel.",
